# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
coverage

# Environment files may hold real secrets (Microsoft client IDs, API base URLs pointing at
# internal hosts); only the checked-in template is safe to commit.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Tracked on purpose: it holds only the invariants of a production build (no secrets),
# so CI, docker build and a manual build read the same values. See the file header.
!.env.production

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
